  "status": "Three fixture corrections pass 100 repetitions on each target under Go race detection (900 total top-level cases). Full revised RPM qualification and duplicate-route investigation remain.",
  "changes": {
    "TestAccountImportCycle": "nats.Subscribe buffers the responder subscription; flushing the requester does not complete processing on the responder connection. Flush ncCp before the first request.",
    "TestGatewayNoCrashOnInvalidSubject": "Forced interest-only mode does not forward an unadvertised malformed subject, and a local Flush does not complete remote RS updates. Select the legacy mode targeted by the regression. An ordinary message proves B processed the invalid publication; PING markers on the same gateway stream prove preceding RS messages completed before assertions. Disable the short first ping for this test to keep markers unambiguous. Verify the invalid no-interest entry exists before and remains after the nonmatching wildcard, then verify valid delivery.",
    "TestNewRouteNoQueueSubscribersBounce": "A client-side Close returns before server A consumes EOF. The immediate next request can reach that disappearing client. Complete server-side DisconnectClientByID first, retaining all 500 requests and validating payloads; this establishes the no-subscriber precondition of the route-bounce regression."
  },
